patch.description:
Sample request - 1:
            
    PATCH /v2/devices/{deviceId}/points
    {
      "parameterId" : "value",
      "smartHomeCategory" : "value"
    }


Where:
* deviceId - ID of the device;
* parameterId - ID of the specific device parameter;
* value - a new value for this parameter;
* smartHomeCategory - smart home category of the device that needs to be updated.


Both parameter ID and smart home category can be used interchangeably in the request.

Sample request - 1:
            
    PATCH /v2/groups/{groupId}/points
    {
      "parameterId" : "value",
      "smartHomeCategory" : "value"
    }


Where:
* groupId - id of the specific group;
* parameterId - id of the specific device parameter;
* value - a new value for this parameter;
* smartHomeCategory - smart home category of the device that needs to be updated.


Both parameter ID and smart home category can be used interchangeably in the request.
